  "doc.title": "What Quantum Computers Can Actually Do · An Essay from First Principles to the Frontier",
  "doc.desc": "What can a quantum computer do that an ordinary computer cannot? The page includes a real quantum-state simulator: from one qubit, interference and entanglement, through Grover's search, Shor's factoring, noise and error correction, to the 2026 frontier with every date and source marked.",
  "nav.back": "← Knowledge Index",
